    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/accursed-staff.json",
    "description": "<p>Iron strips line the body of an <em>accursed staff</em>, capping the bottom and folding into an intricate knot at the top. While wielding an <em>accursed staff</em>, you're empowered by the curses you inflict. If an enemy fails a saving throw against a spell you cast that has the curse trait, you gain temporary Hit Points equal to double that spell's rank. These temporary Hit Points last 10 minutes. The enemy must be a significant threat and can't have been a willing subject of the curse.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Daze]</li><li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Bane], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ill Omen]</li><li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Blood Vendetta], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Warrior's Regret]</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
