    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/amphisbaena-handwraps.json",
    "description": "<p>Your hands fit through the venomous mouths of this pair of handwraps made from amphisbaena skin. Your unarmed strikes gain the versatile P trait. <em>Amphisbaena handwraps</em> can have weapon runes etched onto them, similar to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Handwraps of Mighty Blows].</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Twin Venom Strike</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> Make two unarmed Strikes. Both Strikes count toward your multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after both attacks. Each Strike deals an additional 1d6 poison damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> The initial raw materials must include the skin and heads of an amphisbaena.</p>",
