    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/atmospheric-staff.json",
    "description": "<p>This staff is made of a dense wood and strikes the ground with an imposing boom. At the top of the staff is a perfectly round obsidian sphere that, when stared at for too long, makes viewers feel as though they're heavier than before. When wielding this staff, you gain a +1 item bonus to saves against forced movement.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gale Blast]</li><li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Air Bubble], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gravitational Pull]</li><li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gentle Breeze]</li><li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gravity Well], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Tempest Cloak]</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
