    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/beast-staff.json",
    "description": "<p>The visages of beasts are carved into the painted wood of a <em>beast staff</em>, with a large head on top. When used as a weapon, the staff is a <em>+1 striking staff</em>. While wielding the staff while you have it prepared, you're affected by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Speak with Animals]. If you have @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Animal Empathy], you gain a +1 circumstance bonus on checks using it.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gouging Claw]</li><li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Pest Form], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Runic Body]</li><li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Animal Form], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enlarge]</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
