    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/staves/birchstaff-major.json",
    "description": "<p>This staff is carved of golden birchwood, and its roughly patterned surface resembles tree bark. While wielding the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your Fortitude DC against attempts to [[/act reposition]], [[/act shove]], or [[/act trip]] you.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Timber]</p></li><li><p><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Protector Tree], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wooden Fists]</p></li><li><p><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Helpful Wood Spirits], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Splinter Volley]</p></li><li><p><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Soothing Blossoms], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wooden Double], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wooden Fists]</p></li><li><p><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Blood Chestnuts], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Life-Draining Roots]</p></li><li><p><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Entwined Roots], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Tree of Life and Death]</p></li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
