    "publication": "Pathfinder Lost Omens Highhelm",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/black-king.json",
    "description": "<p>The <em>black king</em> is a <em>+2 greater striking ashen blunderbuss</em>. While the dark metal frame is still pleasant to look at, this design prioritizes destructive power over aesthetic appeal. This specialized blunderbuss has a scatter radius of 20 feet instead of 10, and all splash damage it deals is void damage instead of physical. Due to the risk of collateral damage, this weapon is typically only used by the especially foolhardy or reckless.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> envision, Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day;</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You unleash a blast of draining flame, dealing @Damage[5d6[fire],5d6[void]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in a 60 foot cone (@Check[reflex|dc:34|basic|options:area-effect] save). Creatures who fail their saving throw are knocked back 5 feet. Creatures who critically fail are knocked back 10 feet and fall @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone].</p>",
    "plainDescription": "The black king is a +2 greater striking ashen blunderbuss . While the dark metal frame is still pleasant to look at, this design prioritizes destructive power over aesthetic appeal. This specialized blunderbuss has a scatter radius of 20 feet instead of 10, and all splash damage it deals is void damage instead of physical. Due to the risk of collateral damage, this weapon is typically only used by the especially foolhardy or reckless. Activate 2 envision, Interact Frequency once per day; Effect You unleash a blast of draining flame, dealing @Damage[5d6[fire],5d6[void]|options:area-damage] damage to all creatures in a 60 foot cone (@Check[reflex|dc:34|basic|options:area-effect] save). Creatures who fail their saving throw are knocked back 5 feet. Creatures who critically fail are knocked back 10 feet and fall Prone.",
