    "rarity": "common",
    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Impossible Magic",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/blessed-lantern-flail.json",
    "description": "<p>This <em>+2 striking holy flail</em> doubles as both a hooded lantern and a bludgeoning weapon, giving off bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for the next 30 feet when wielded. The lantern's light can't be extinguished by non-magical means. It's said that an enlightened gravekeeper crafted the first <em>blessed lantern flail</em>.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Purge Unholy Magic</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You use the flail to temporarily disrupt an unholy spellcaster's connection to their magic. Make a melee Strike with the flail against an unholy creature with innate or prepared spells. If you hit and deal damage, the target must attempt a @Check[will|dc:31] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is otherwise unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> Until the beginning of your next turn, the creature must succeed at a @Check[flat|dc:5] to Cast a Spell.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> As success, but the effect lasts for 1 minute.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, but the DC of the flat check is 11.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "This +2 striking holy flail doubles as both a hooded lantern and a bludgeoning weapon, giving off bright light in a 30-foot radius and dim light for the next 30 feet when wielded. The lantern's light can't be extinguished by non-magical means. It's said that an enlightened gravekeeper crafted the first blessed lantern flail . Activate—Purge Unholy Magic 1 (concentrate) Frequency once per 10 minutes Effect You use the flail to temporarily disrupt an unholy spellcaster's connection to their magic. Make a melee Strike with the flail against an unholy creature with innate or prepared spells. If you hit and deal damage, the target must attempt a @Check[will|dc:31] save. Critical Success The creature is otherwise unaffected. Success Until the beginning of your next turn, the creature must succeed at a @Check[flat|dc:5] to Cast a Spell. Failure As success, but the effect lasts for 1 minute. Critical Failure As failure, but the DC of the flat check is 11.",
    "descriptionHash": "e1d2043090f7cd89",
    "descriptionChars": 961,
