    "publication": "Pathfinder Treasure Vault (Remastered)",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/boulder-seed.json",
    "description": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p>This bomb is made of volatile fluids that rapidly expand and harden when exposed to air. A boulder seed grants a +2 item bonus to attack rolls and deals 3d4 bludgeoning damage and 3 bludgeoning splash damage. When activated, the bomb fills a @Template[cube|distance:5] with hardened foam, which creates a boulder as hard as wood (Hardness 5, HP 20) that pushes the primary target of Medium size or smaller occupying that space 5 feet away from you. On a critical hit, the target also falls @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone]. The splash zone fills with rubble, creating difficult terrain. The \"boulder\" the bomb creates fails all saving throws and loses 1 Hardness per round, disintegrating into fine powder when the boulder's Hardness is reduced to 0. At that time, the difficult terrain the bomb created also disappears.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Activate 1 Strike This bomb is made of volatile fluids that rapidly expand and harden when exposed to air. A boulder seed grants a +2 item bonus to attack rolls and deals 3d4 bludgeoning damage and 3 bludgeoning splash damage. When activated, the bomb fills a @Template[cube|distance:5] with hardened foam, which creates a boulder as hard as wood (Hardness 5, HP 20) that pushes the primary target of Medium size or smaller occupying that space 5 feet away from you. On a critical hit, the target also falls Prone. The splash zone fills with rubble, creating difficult terrain. The \"boulder\" the bomb creates fails all saving throws and loses 1 Hardness per round, disintegrating into fine powder when the boulder's Hardness is reduced to 0. At that time, the difficult terrain the bomb created also disappears.",
