    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Impossible Magic",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/staves/continuum-staff.json",
    "description": "<p>A looped band of copper, winding in on itself, sits atop the head of this shiny metal staff. The staff's surface seems to warp unpredictably when viewed, the reflections across the shiny surface of its length never forming the same pattern twice.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Restitch Time</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> (fortune, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You would fail or critically fail an attack roll, saving throw, or skill check</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You briefly reverse time to fix your error. Reroll the triggering check, taking the better of the two results.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Warp Step]</p></li><li><p><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Déjà Vu], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Synchronize]</p></li><li><p><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unrelenting Gravity]</p></li><li><p><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Haste], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Inertia Lock], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Time Jump]</p></li><li><p><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Flicker], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Translocate], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unrelenting Gravity]</p></li><li><p><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Rewinding Step], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Space Fold Gate], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Translocate]</p></li><li><p><strong>6th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Cast into Time], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Collective Transposition]</p></li><li><p><strong>7th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Infinitesimal Collapse Field], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Space Fold Gate]</p></li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
