    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/dazzling-shortbow.json",
    "description": "<p>This <em>+1 striking shortbow</em> is a favorite of mage hunters and those who frequently fight enemies who can turn themselves @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Invisible]. A creature who is critically hit with a ranged Strike from a <em>dazzling shortbow</em> must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:19] save or be @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 minute.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Show Yourself!</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You fire an arrow that glows with purple light at a spot. Each creature in a @Template[type:burst|distance:10] within 60 feet is affected by @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Revealing Light] (DC 19).</p><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of <em>revealing light</em>.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "This +1 striking shortbow is a favorite of mage hunters and those who frequently fight enemies who can turn themselves Invisible. A creature who is critically hit with a ranged Strike from a dazzling shortbow must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:19] save or be Dazzled for 1 minute. Activate—Show Yourself! 2 (concentrate) Frequency once per day Effect You fire an arrow that glows with purple light at a spot. Each creature in a @Template[type:burst|distance:10] within 60 feet is affected by (DC 19). Craft Requirements Supply one casting of revealing light .",
