    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/dezullon-fountain.json",
    "description": "<p>A <em>dezullon fountain</em> is a distinct type of <em>+2 striking air repeater</em> made from the still-living pitcher of a dezullon, dealing acid damage instead of the gun's normal piercing damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The next creature you successfully Strike with this weapon is exposed to amnesia venom.</p>\n<p><strong>Amnesia Venom</strong> (mental, poison)</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:29|traits:mental,poison]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 6 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 2</strong> off-guard and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} (1 round)</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 3</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Confused], off-guard, and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 2} (1 round)</p><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> The initial raw materials must include a pitcher from a dezullon or similar creature.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "A dezullon fountain is a distinct type of +2 striking air repeater made from the still-living pitcher of a dezullon, dealing acid damage instead of the gun's normal piercing damage. Activate 1 (concentrate) Frequency once per day Effect The next creature you successfully Strike with this weapon is exposed to amnesia venom. Amnesia Venom (mental, poison) Saving Throw @Check[fortitude|dc:29|traits:mental,poison] Maximum Duration 6 rounds Stage 1 Off Guard (1 round) Stage 2 off-guard and Clumsy 1 (1 round) Stage 3 Confused, off-guard, and Clumsy 2 (1 round) Craft Requirements The initial raw materials must include a pitcher from a dezullon or similar creature.",
