    "rarity": "unique",
    "edition": "legacy",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Adventure: Crown of the Kobold King",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/drazmorgs-staff-of-all-sight.json",
    "description": "<p>This long, gnarled staff looks like several bones fused together, then wrapped tightly with strips of desiccated, gray skin. At the top of the staff, a clump of sinew clasps a small stone orb resembling a large human eye. When the staff is activated, this eye twitches and glances around randomly. When wielding this staff, you gain a +1 item bonus to visual Perception checks.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Cast a Spell]</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Read Aura]</li>\n<li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sure Strike]</li>\n<li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Darkvision], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Floating Flame] (creates what appears to be a large eye made of fire), @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.See the Unseen]</li>\n<li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Organsight], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Web of Eyes]</li>\n<li><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Clairvoyance], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Countless Eyes], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Detect Scrying]</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "This long, gnarled staff looks like several bones fused together, then wrapped tightly with strips of desiccated, gray skin. At the top of the staff, a clump of sinew clasps a small stone orb resembling a large human eye. When the staff is activated, this eye twitches and glances around randomly. When wielding this staff, you gain a +1 item bonus to visual Perception checks. Activate Effect You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip 1st 2nd Darkvision, (creates what appears to be a large eye made of fire), 3rd Organsight, 4th Clairvoyance, , Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.",
