    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/dwarven-daisy-lesser.json",
    "description": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A dwarven daisy is a string of dozens of firecrackers that create tiny, loud explosions. The string ends with a short, wrapped fuse. Pulling off the wrapping in a quick motion lights the fuse and is done as part of the action to Strike. A dwarven daisy deals the listed fire damage and splash damage. A dwarven daisy also has a chance to dazzle its target. A creature struck by a dwarven daisy must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:16|name:Lesser Dwarven Daisy|traits:damaging-effect|showDC:all] save or become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 round.</p>\n<p>The firework deals 1d6 fire damage and 1 fire splash damage. The DC is 16.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Activate 1 Strike A dwarven daisy is a string of dozens of firecrackers that create tiny, loud explosions. The string ends with a short, wrapped fuse. Pulling off the wrapping in a quick motion lights the fuse and is done as part of the action to Strike. A dwarven daisy deals the listed fire damage and splash damage. A dwarven daisy also has a chance to dazzle its target. A creature struck by a dwarven daisy must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:16|name:Lesser Dwarven Daisy|traits:damaging-effect|showDC:all] save or become Dazzled for 1 round. The firework deals 1d6 fire damage and 1 fire splash damage. The DC is 16.",
