    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/staves/fanged-staff.json",
    "description": "<p>Carved of the finest bloodwood, this staff is an elegant walking stick with a sharp metal point at its base. Fanged staves are popular among favored mortal retainers of vampires. While wielding a fanged staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws against void effects.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Daze]</p></li><li><p><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Command], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Grim Tendrils]</p></li><li><p><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Blood Vendetta], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Draw Blood]</p></li><li><p><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enthrall], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vampiric Feast]</p></li><li><p><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sanguine Mist], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vampiric Maiden]</p></li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Carved of the finest bloodwood, this staff is an elegant walking stick with a sharp metal point at its base. Fanged staves are popular among favored mortal retainers of vampires. While wielding a fanged staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to saving throws against void effects. Activate Cast a Spell Effect You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip Daze 1st Command, 2nd , 3rd Enthrall, 4th , Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.",
