    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/fighters-fork.json",
    "description": "<p>This <em>+1 trident</em>, usually engraved with a decorative pattern resembling fish scales, is a common weapon among warriors of aquatic ancestries.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Fluid Length</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">A</span> manipulate</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You extend or shorten the trident's haft. When extended, the trident requires two hands to wield and gains the reach trait, but loses the trident's normal thrown trait.</p>",
