    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/forked-bipod.json",
    "description": "<p>Developed by Alkenstar scouts who often don't have time to break down a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Tripod] when beset by the chaotic mutant monsters of the Mana Wastes, this two-pronged stabbing weapon can be used as a bipod to stabilize a gun with potent kickback. A forked bipod can be deployed or retrieved for use as a melee weapon as an Interact action. As with a Tripod, you can change your grip on the weapon as part of this action.</p>",
