    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/generals-word.json",
    "description": "<p>The mere act of wielding this heavy <em>+2 greater striking thundering mace</em> grants you a distinct air of authority and gravitas. While wielding the weapon, you can cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Bullhorn] as a 1st-rank cantrip at will.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Battlefield Broadcast</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (concentrate, linguistic, manipulate, mental, occult)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The weapon amplifies your force of personality across the battlefield with the effects of @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Telepathy] for 10 minutes, except the range is 500 feet. The effect ends immediately if you drop your weapon.</p><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of <em>bullhorn</em> and <em>telepathy</em>.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "The mere act of wielding this heavy +2 greater striking thundering mace grants you a distinct air of authority and gravitas. While wielding the weapon, you can cast Bullhorn as a 1st-rank cantrip at will. Activate—Battlefield Broadcast 2 (concentrate, linguistic, manipulate, mental, occult) Frequency once per day Effect The weapon amplifies your force of personality across the battlefield with the effects of Telepathy for 10 minutes, except the range is 500 feet. The effect ends immediately if you drop your weapon. Craft Requirements Supply one casting of bullhorn and telepathy .",
