    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/giant-squid-lash.json",
    "description": "<p>Three dried tentacles from a giant squid studded with pufferfish spines have been twisted together to form this robust <em>+1 @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Wounding] whip</em>. With a clever flick of the wrist, they can be unfurled into a deadly arc of poisonous barbs.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Poison Barrage</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You lash out with the whip's three tentacles in a @Template[cone|distance:15]. Each creature inside the cone must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:27|basic|options:area-effect] save or take @Damage[4d6[poison]|options:area-damage] damage. On a critical failure, the creature also takes @Damage[1d6[persistent,poison]] damage.</p><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> The initial raw materials must include three tentacles from a giant squid.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Three dried tentacles from a giant squid studded with pufferfish spines have been twisted together to form this robust +1 Wounding whip . With a clever flick of the wrist, they can be unfurled into a deadly arc of poisonous barbs. Activate—Poison Barrage 2 (manipulate) Frequency once per hour Effect You lash out with the whip's three tentacles in a @Template[cone|distance:15]. Each creature inside the cone must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:27|basic|options:area-effect] save or take @Damage[4d6[poison]|options:area-damage] damage. On a critical failure, the creature also takes @Damage[1d6[persistent,poison]] damage. Craft Requirements The initial raw materials must include three tentacles from a giant squid.",
