    "description": "<p>Metal caps the bottom of this <em>+1 striking thundering dancer's spear</em> and its point gives off the faint smell of ozone. If you hit a target that has been struck by a polarizing mace within the last round, you deal additional electricity damage to the target equal to the number of <em>grounding spike</em>'s damage dice. If you critically hit such a target, the creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard] until the start of your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Special</strong> The <em>grounding spike</em> pairs with the <em>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Polarizing Mace]</em>.</p>",
