    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/guardian-staff.json",
    "description": "<p>A <em>guardian staff</em> is formed from ivory strands woven in a diamond pattern and capped with a glowing ruby. Those charged with protecting others value this staff's spells.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You raise the staff and choose an ally within 10 feet. A ruby-colored plane of force appears like a shield near the ally, granting them a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn. If you use this action again, any creature you previously granted this bonus to loses it.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.Effect: Guardian Staff]</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Forbidding Ward]</li><li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sanctuary], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spirit Link]</li><li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Share Life], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spirit Link]</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "A guardian staff is formed from ivory strands woven in a diamond pattern and capped with a glowing ruby. Those charged with protecting others value this staff's spells. Activate 1 (concentrate) Effect You raise the staff and choose an ally within 10 feet. A ruby-colored plane of force appears like a shield near the ally, granting them a +1 circumstance bonus to AC until the start of your next turn. If you use this action again, any creature you previously granted this bonus to loses it. Activate Cast a Spell Effect You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip 1st Sanctuary, 2nd , Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.",
