    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/habus-cudgel.json",
    "description": "<p>Long associated with a notorious crime boss in Nantambu, this stout <em>+1 striking fearsome club</em> is studded with vicious-looking knobs of obsidian and wrapped in cloth for a better grip. It emits a ghastly groan when swung.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> Interact</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You gesture at a square within 40 feet with <em>Habu's Cudgel</em>. The club causes a frightful wail to unleash from that square and casts @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fear] (@Check[will|dc:24|name:Habu's Cudgel Fear|traits:enchantment,evocation,emotion,fear,mental,unique]) targeting the creature in that square and all adjacent creatures.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Long associated with a notorious crime boss in Nantambu, this stout +1 striking fearsome club is studded with vicious-looking knobs of obsidian and wrapped in cloth for a better grip. It emits a ghastly groan when swung. Activate 2 Interact Frequency once per day Effect You gesture at a square within 40 feet with Habu's Cudgel . The club causes a frightful wail to unleash from that square and casts Fear (@Check[will|dc:24|name:Habu's Cudgel Fear|traits:enchantment,evocation,emotion,fear,mental,unique]) targeting the creature in that square and all adjacent creatures.",
