    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/hydra-spear.json",
    "description": "<p>This <em>+1 striking longspear</em> of polished white bone features a tip of layered reptilian scales, compressed to form a sharp edge. Akki crafted this spear herself after she and her allies tangled with a hydra plaguing the marshes outside Aelyosos. She pressed the scales of the creature down into a spearpoint mostly through sheer stubbornness, granting it a unique ability.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Hydra Swipe</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span></p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The spearhead unravels and elongates into a group of snake heads. Make up to three melee Strikes with the <em>Hydra Spear</em>, each at a different creature within 20 feet. These attacks do not count toward your multiple attack penalty until all attacks have been resolved.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "This +1 striking longspear of polished white bone features a tip of layered reptilian scales, compressed to form a sharp edge. Akki crafted this spear herself after she and her allies tangled with a hydra plaguing the marshes outside Aelyosos. She pressed the scales of the creature down into a spearpoint mostly through sheer stubbornness, granting it a unique ability. Activate—Hydra Swipe 2 Frequency once per hour Effect The spearhead unravels and elongates into a group of snake heads. Make up to three melee Strikes with the Hydra Spear , each at a different creature within 20 feet. These attacks do not count toward your multiple attack penalty until all attacks have been resolved.",
