    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/jorngarls-harm.json",
    "description": "<p>This oversized greataxe, infamous for the chilling laughter it emits whenever it takes a life, was crafted by the frost giant sorcerer Jorngarl from the final blade named Toothy Morris after it was stolen in an attack on a Gray Gardener convoy. It functions as a <em>+3 major striking vorpal greataxe</em> that retains the unique properties of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Final Blade], trapping the souls of any it slays and preventing them from being returned to life by any means short of divine intervention, even a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wish] ritual or similar magic.</p>",
