    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/lodestone-bomb.json",
    "description": "<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> Strike</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Lodestone bombs hold reactive ionized minerals preserved in a dormant state until broken. The bomb grants a +2 item bonus to attack rolls and deals 3d4 force damage and 2 force splash damage. In addition, a target made of metal, wearing metal armor, or using metal weapons takes @Damage[2d4[persistent,force]] and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1} while taking the persistent damage. The persistent damage can last up to 1 minute.</p>",
