    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/staves/memento-mori-staff.json",
    "description": "<p>A carved nosoi figurine sits atop this white ash staff, which carries the faint scent of funereal herbs. These staves are often used by Pharasmins to communicate with the unquiet dead and lay them to rest. A memento mori staff is a <em>+2 striking astral staff</em>.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Pierce the Veil</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The staff searches for undead, warming to your touch if there are any undead within 60 feet. It cannot identify the precise location of the undead, nor their exact numbers. You can Sustain this effect for a maximum of 1 minute.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><p><strong>Cantrip</strong>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vitality Lash]</p></li><li><p><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Bless], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Infuse Vitality]</p></li><li><p><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Palm-Held Sun], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Spirit Sense]</p></li><li><p><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Anointed Ground], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Reblooded]</p></li><li><p><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ghostly Tragedy], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Talking Corpse]</p></li><li><p><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Infuse Vitality], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Peaceful Rest]</p></li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "A carved nosoi figurine sits atop this white ash staff, which carries the faint scent of funereal herbs. These staves are often used by Pharasmins to communicate with the unquiet dead and lay them to rest. A memento mori staff is a +2 striking astral staff . Activate—Pierce the Veil 1 (concentrate, manipulate) Frequency once per hour Effect The staff searches for undead, warming to your touch if there are any undead within 60 feet. It cannot identify the precise location of the undead, nor their exact numbers. You can Sustain this effect for a maximum of 1 minute. Activate Cast a Spell Effect You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip 1st Bless, 2nd , 3rd , Reblooded 4th , 5th , Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.",
