    "edition": "legacy",
    "publication": "Pathfinder #161: Belly of the Black Whale",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/nightmare-cudgel.json",
    "description": "<p>Crafted from polished wood, this seemingly mundane <em>+1 striking @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Club]</em> comes with a red leather strap near the handle. The mere sight of the cudgel in a guard's hand fills prisoners with dread.</p>\n<p>Good creatures are @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 2} while carrying, wielding, or wearing this item crafted by the sea-witches.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> Interact (emotion, mental)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You initiate an intimidating walk, thumping the cudgel menacingly against your palm. As part of activating this item, you can Stride twice. For the next minute, whenever you successfully Strike a creature with the <em>nightmare cudgel</em>, you can use a free action to attempt an Intimidation check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Demoralize] the struck creature.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Crafted from polished wood, this seemingly mundane +1 striking Club comes with a red leather strap near the handle. The mere sight of the cudgel in a guard's hand fills prisoners with dread. Good creatures are Enfeebled 2 while carrying, wielding, or wearing this item crafted by the sea-witches. Activate 2 Interact (emotion, mental) Frequency once per day Effect You initiate an intimidating walk, thumping the cudgel menacingly against your palm. As part of activating this item, you can Stride twice. For the next minute, whenever you successfully Strike a creature with the nightmare cudgel , you can use a free action to attempt an Intimidation check to Demoralize the struck creature.",
