    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/pirate-staff.json",
    "description": "<p>Carved of salt-stained driftwood white with the salt of the sea, a <em>pirate staff</em> has jewels and gold pieces embedded in the wood. A skull and crossbones sit on top. When used as a weapon, the staff is a <em>+2 striking fearsome</em> staff. While wielding the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Intimidation checks to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Coerce].</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gale Blast], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Know the Way]</li><li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Seashell of Stolen Sound]</li><li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mist], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water Breathing], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water Walk]</li><li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mind of Menace], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water Breathing]</li><li><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Coral Eruption], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water Breathing], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Water Walk]</li><li><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Flowing Strike], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mariner's Curse]</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "Carved of salt-stained driftwood white with the salt of the sea, a pirate staff has jewels and gold pieces embedded in the wood. A skull and crossbones sit on top. When used as a weapon, the staff is a +2 striking fearsome staff. While wielding the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Intimidation checks to Coerce. Activate Cast a Spell Effect You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip , 1st 2nd Mist, , 3rd , 4th , , 5th , Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.",
