    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/pistol-wand.json",
    "description": "<p>Used by gunwitches who want a bit more power each day, a <em>pistol wand</em> is a firearm that also contains an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enfeeble] spell that can be cast using the same rules as a wand. Many other variants exist with different 1st-rank spells. This <em>+1 flintlock pistol</em> has a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Reinforced Stock] permanently attached to it, and the pistol's <em>potency rune</em> (and any other runes) applies to Strikes with the stock as well.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day, plus overcharge</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You cast <em>enfeeble</em>.</p>",
