    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/returning-starknife.json",
    "description": "<p>This <em>returning throwing knife</em> is specially made for Lyrune-Quah hunters, and its blade is carved with constellations.</p>\n<p><strong>Ribbon Wrap</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per hour</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You deal damage to a target with the starknife</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Silver ribbons of starlight entangle the target, dealing @Damage[4d6[spirit]] damage. This is silver damage for the purposes of weaknesses, resistances, and the like. The target must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:24] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature takes half damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Clumsy]{Clumsy 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Immobilized] for 1 round.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature takes full damage and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Restrained] with an @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Escape] DC of 24.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "This returning throwing knife is specially made for Lyrune-Quah hunters, and its blade is carved with constellations. Ribbon Wrap r (concentrate) Frequency once per hour Trigger You deal damage to a target with the starknife Effect Silver ribbons of starlight entangle the target, dealing @Damage[4d6[spirit]] damage. This is silver damage for the purposes of weaknesses, resistances, and the like. The target must attempt a @Check[reflex|dc:24] save. Critical Success The creature is unaffected. Success The creature takes half damage and is Clumsy 1. Failure The creature takes full damage and is Immobilized for 1 round. Critical Failure The creature takes full damage and is Restrained with an Escape DC of 24.",
