    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/serpent-dagger.json",
    "description": "<p>The serrated blade of this <em>+1 striking dagger</em> has a greenish tinge, and the hilt is sculpted to look like the head of a serpent about to strike.</p>\n<p>When you critically succeed at an attack roll with the <em>serpent dagger</em>, the target becomes @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} unless it succeeds at a @Check[fortitude|dc:19] save. This is a poison effect.</p>\n<p>In addition, you can activate the dagger to poison a creature with a more potent poison.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Drip Poison</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">F</span> (manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You damage a creature with the <em>serpent dagger</em></p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You poison the creature you hit with dagger venom.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Dagger Venom</strong> (poison)</p>\n<p><strong>Saving Throw</strong> @Check[fortitude|dc:21]</p>\n<p><strong>Maximum Duration</strong> 4 rounds</p>\n<p><strong>Stage 1</strong> @Damage[1d8[poison]] damage and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Enfeebled]{Enfeebled 1}</p>",
    "plainDescription": "The serrated blade of this +1 striking dagger has a greenish tinge, and the hilt is sculpted to look like the head of a serpent about to strike. When you critically succeed at an attack roll with the serpent dagger , the target becomes Sickened 1 unless it succeeds at a @Check[fortitude|dc:19] save. This is a poison effect. In addition, you can activate the dagger to poison a creature with a more potent poison. Activate—Drip Poison F (manipulate) Frequency once per day Trigger You damage a creature with the serpent dagger Effect You poison the creature you hit with dagger venom. Dagger Venom (poison) Saving Throw @Check[fortitude|dc:21] Maximum Duration 4 rounds Stage 1 @Damage[1d8[poison]] damage and Enfeebled 1",
