    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/shuln-fang-katar.json",
    "description": "<p>This <em>+2 greater striking katar</em> masterfully crafted from the adamantine-laced fang of a shuln can puncture even the toughest of armors.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Piercing Critical</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per round</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your last action was to score a critical hit with the <em>shuln fang katar</em> against a creature that is wearing armor</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You deal the same amount of damage as the critical hit to the creature's armor, bypassing any Hardness lower than 10, like adamantine.</p><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> The initial raw materials must include a fang from a shuln.</p>",
