    "description": "<p>This <em>+2 striking frost staff</em> is an heirloom that was gifted to Alzarius by his mother when he made his choice to remain in Xer. It is a gift he claims has been handed down through generations of spellcasters in his family.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p><ul><li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Frostbite]</li><li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Environmental Endurance], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Resist Energy]</li><li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Environmental Endurance], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Slow], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall of Wind]</li><li><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Ice Storm], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Resist Energy], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vapor Form]</li><li><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Environmental Endurance], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Howling Blizzard], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall of Ice]</li></ul><hr /><p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
