    "edition": "remaster",
    "publication": "Pathfinder Impossible Magic",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/south-winds-scorch-song.json",
    "description": "<p>This <em>+1 striking flaming scimitar</em> is always warm to the touch, nearly unbearably so. Lines of crackling flame radiate from carnelians affixed to its curved and blackened blade, and its pommel ends in a brilliant tassel of phoenix feathers. While you have a status bonus to at least one of your Speeds, your Strikes with this scimitar that deal fire damage gain a +2 status bonus to their fire damage. The status bonus increases to +3 if the weapon has a greater striking rune and +4 for major striking.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.Effect: South Wind's Scorch Song (Damage)]</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Warming Zephyr</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> (air, fire, magical, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per minute</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You deal fire damage to a creature with a spell or ability</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You point the south wind's scorch song upward, summoning a wind from nowhere that grants you a +10-foot status bonus to your Speeds until the end of your next turn.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.Effect: South Wind's Scorch Song (Speed Boost)]</p>",
    "plainDescription": "This +1 striking flaming scimitar is always warm to the touch, nearly unbearably so. Lines of crackling flame radiate from carnelians affixed to its curved and blackened blade, and its pommel ends in a brilliant tassel of phoenix feathers. While you have a status bonus to at least one of your Speeds, your Strikes with this scimitar that deal fire damage gain a +2 status bonus to their fire damage. The status bonus increases to +3 if the weapon has a greater striking rune and +4 for major striking. Activate—Warming Zephyr f (air, fire, magical, manipulate) Frequency once per minute Trigger You deal fire damage to a creature with a spell or ability Effect You point the south wind's scorch song upward, summoning a wind from nowhere that grants you a +10-foot status bonus to your Speeds until the end of your next turn.",
