    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/spore-sap.json",
    "description": "<p>This flexible +2 striking sap is crafted from the stalks of cave fungi and bound around a mesh of spore-infused gills. Demon-worshipping xulgaths use spore saps to capture spellcasters alive for later sacrifice.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">R</span> Interact (poison)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> three times per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You successfully Strike a creature with the <em>spore sap</em></p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The <em>spore sap</em> releases a puff of stupefying fungal spores. The target must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:28] or become stupefied 1 for 1 minute (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stupefied]{Stupefied 2} on a critical failure).</p>",
