    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/staff-of-arcane-might.json",
    "description": "<p>This staff of magically hardened wood is topped with a silver sculpture depicting magical runic symbols. A staff of arcane might is a <em>+1 striking staff</em>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate—Sunder</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> (death, force, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You destroy the staff, unleashing a blast of arcane power in a @Template[cone|distance:30], dealing @Damage[2d6[force]] damage per charge remaining in the staff with a @Check[reflex|dc:30|traits:death,force|basic] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Detect Magic]</li>\n<li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal Minion]</li>\n<li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Everlight]</li>\n<li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Force Barrage], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Paralyze]</li>\n<li><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dispelling Globe], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mystic Armor], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Translocate]</li>\n<li><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fireball], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Force Barrage], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Lightning Bolt]</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "This staff of magically hardened wood is topped with a silver sculpture depicting magical runic symbols. A staff of arcane might is a +1 striking staff . Activate—Sunder 2 (death, force, manipulate) Effect You destroy the staff, unleashing a blast of arcane power in a @Template[cone|distance:30], dealing @Damage[2d6[force]] damage per charge remaining in the staff with a @Check[reflex|dc:30|traits:death,force|basic] save. Activate Cast a Spell Effect You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip 1st 2nd Everlight 3rd , Paralyze 4th , , Translocate 5th Fireball, , Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells.",
