    "publication": "Pathfinder Core Rulebook",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/staff-of-power.json",
    "description": "<p>This staff of magically hardened wood is topped with a silver sculpture depicting magical runic symbols. When used as a weapon, a <em>staff of power</em> is a <em>+2 greater striking staff</em>.</p>\n<p>Voluntarily destroying a <em>staff of power</em> unleashes an incredible blast of energy. When wielding the staff, you can Interact to break it. This releases a @Template[burst|distance:30] magical explosion centered on the staff. This deals @Damage[2d8[force]|options:area-damage] damage per charge remaining in the staff (@Check[reflex|dc:40|basic|options:area-effect]). You automatically critically fail your save. A creature reduced to 0 Hit Points by this damage dies instantly; this is a death effect.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Enfeeble]</li>\n<li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Everlight]</li>\n<li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Levitate]</li>\n<li><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dispelling Globe], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Paralyze]</li>\n<li><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Force Barrage]</li>\n<li><strong>6th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall of Force]</li>\n<li><strong>7th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Cone of Cold], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fireball], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Lightning Bolt]</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "This staff of magically hardened wood is topped with a silver sculpture depicting magical runic symbols. When used as a weapon, a staff of power is a +2 greater striking staff . Voluntarily destroying a staff of power unleashes an incredible blast of energy. When wielding the staff, you can Interact to break it. This releases a @Template[burst|distance:30] magical explosion centered on the staff. This deals @Damage[2d8[force]|options:area-damage] damage per charge remaining in the staff (@Check[reflex|dc:40|basic|options:area-effect]). You automatically critically fail your save. A creature reduced to 0 Hit Points by this damage dies instantly; this is a death effect. Activate Cast a Spell Effect You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. 1st Enfeeble 2nd Everlight 3rd Levitate 4th , Paralyze 5th 6th 7th , Fireball, Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.",
