    "publication": "Pathfinder #155: Lord of the Black Sands",
    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/staff-of-the-black-desert.json",
    "description": "<p>This rough metal staff is pitted and sandblasted, with thousands of nigh-imperceptible sand crystals embedded in its surface.</p>\n<p>While carrying the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Occultism checks to identify aberrations and oozes native to the Darklands.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> Cast a Spell</p>\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Know the Way]</li>\n<li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Create Water] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Cleanse Cuisine] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal Minion]</li>\n<li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Darkvision] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Environmental Endurance]</li>\n<li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Earthbind] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Cleanse Affliction] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wanderer's Guide]</li>\n<li><strong>4th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Air Walk] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Mirage] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Rope Trick]</li>\n<li><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Pillars of Sand] @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Disguise]</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "This rough metal staff is pitted and sandblasted, with thousands of nigh-imperceptible sand crystals embedded in its surface. While carrying the staff, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Occultism checks to identify aberrations and oozes native to the Darklands. Activate Cast a Spell Effect You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip 1st 2nd Darkvision 3rd Earthbind 4th Mirage 5th Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.",
