    "description": "<p>The carved night hag's hand at the end of this sandalwood staff clutches a rough gem. The <em>Staff of the Dreamlands</em> makes it easier to navigate and survive in the Dreamlands and recognize its denizens. When wielding the staff, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Survival checks while in the Dreamlands and to checks to Recall Knowledge about creatures with the dream trait.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Cast a Spell]</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list.</p>\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cantrip</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Daze]</li>\n<li><strong>1st</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Alarm], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Déjà Vu], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Sleep]</li>\n<li><strong>2nd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Phantasmal Treasure], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Silence]</li>\n<li><strong>3rd</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dream Message]</li>\n<li><strong>4th</strong> <em>dream message</em>, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Nightmare], <em>sleep</em></li>\n<li><strong>5th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dreaming Potential], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Illusory Scene]</li>\n<li><strong>6th</strong> <em>illusory scene</em></li>\n<li><strong>7th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Project Image], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Visions of Danger]</li>\n<li><strong>8th</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Dream Council], @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Quandary], <em>visions of danger</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Craft Requirements</strong> Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "The carved night hag's hand at the end of this sandalwood staff clutches a rough gem. The Staff of the Dreamlands makes it easier to navigate and survive in the Dreamlands and recognize its denizens. When wielding the staff, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Survival checks while in the Dreamlands and to checks to Recall Knowledge about creatures with the dream trait. Activate Effect You expend a number of charges from the staff to cast a spell from its list. Cantrip Daze 1st Alarm, , Sleep 2nd , Silence 3rd 4th dream message , Nightmare, sleep 5th , 6th illusory scene 7th , 8th , Quandary, visions of danger Craft Requirements Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells.",
