    "description": "<p>Sparks of crackling electricity arc from this <em>+1 magic warhammer</em>, and the head thrums with distant thunder. Any hit with this hammer deals 1 extra electricity damage. You can use a special action to transform the sparks into lightning bolts.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Electrify</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p>Until the end of your turn, the hammer deals 1d6 extra electricity damage instead of just 1. After you activate the <em>storm hammer</em>, you can't activate it again for 10 minutes.</p>",
