    "path": "packs/pf2e/equipment/sun-sling.json",
    "description": "<p>A sun sling is a small staff with a head of woven netting. The staff is small enough to hold in a single hand, making it useful for hit-and-run tactics, but once loaded with ammunition, it requires two hands to properly swing and fire. This is a martial ranged weapon.</p>\n<p>Sun slings use small metal bullets covered in sharp spikes known as @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.equipment-srd.Item.Sun Shot]{Sun Shots}. A bundle of 10 sun shots has light bulk and costs 1 sp.</p>",
    "plainDescription": "A sun sling is a small staff with a head of woven netting. The staff is small enough to hold in a single hand, making it useful for hit-and-run tactics, but once loaded with ammunition, it requires two hands to properly swing and fire. This is a martial ranged weapon. Sun slings use small metal bullets covered in sharp spikes known as Sun Shots. A bundle of 10 sun shots has light bulk and costs 1 sp.",
