    "description": "<p>Nearly every surface of this heavy <em>+1 striking mace</em> is inscribed with runes of crafting and restoration. The core of the mace hums with an eerie resonance, as if devouring stray magical energies from the air.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Recharge Wand</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">1</span> (concentrate, manipulate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You're wielding a wand capable of casting spells of 3rd rank or lower, and its spell has been cast for the day</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> You tap the wandmender against the wand, restoring its magic. You can Cast the Spell in the wand a second time without overcharging, as long as you do so within the next minute.</p>",
