    "description": "<p>This double-ended silver baton functions as a mundane silver mace. Its shining surface glimmers in the light, making it easy to signal and inspire troops.</p><hr /><p><strong>Activate—Rally Forth</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">f</span> (concentrate)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per day</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> An enemy triggers a reaction from a troop you're currently commanding, but that troop has already used its reaction this turn</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The troop under your command gains a second reaction that they must immediately use against the triggering enemy.</p>",
